('Resident','AU',"Tuesday at four fifteen would be better. Where can my neighbour stop? I remember a car park beside the workshop, but when I walked past last week there seemed to be building materials across its entrance."),
('Assistant','GB',"That car park is closed during the roof repairs. Use the loading space opposite the pharmacy for dropping off, then your neighbour can park in the public car park behind the library. Please don't leave the vehicle in the loading space during the appointment, because other businesses use it too."),
('Resident','AU',"I'll explain that. What should I bring apart from the clock? There is a key in the drawer beneath it and a note that my aunt wrote years ago, although the note doesn't say who made the clock."),
('Assistant','GB',"Bring the key and any documents that belong with it. Don't wind the clock beforehand. If there are loose pieces, keep them in an envelope rather than trying to fit them back. A photograph of how it stood in your aunt's home could also be useful, but it isn't essential for the appointment."),
